  in adhesive capsulitis—a pilot study" — INCLUDE (high confidence). Pilot RCT randomizing primary adhesive capsulitis  
  to two mobilization directions.                                                                                       
  - **Study 13**: "Intraarticular corticosteroids, supervised physiotherapy, or a combination of the two in the         
  treatment of adhesive capsulitis of the shoulder: a placebo-controlled trial" — INCLUDE (high confidence).            
