  - **Study 4**: Open RCT comparing physical therapies alone vs physical therapies plus arthrographic distension and    
  steroid. The comparison does not address manual therapy/exercise efficacy versus placebo/no treatment/different       
  manual therapy or exercise; it addresses an invasive adjunct.                                                         
